        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩndĩ ũnĩ ũsu, Akiliva ooka, na Velinike, na ũsũng’wa mũnene, na mavota vandũ va kwĩthukĩĩsya vamwe na anene ma asikali ngili, na andũ anene ma ndũa, Vesito eeaa Vaulo naetwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
